# Butler Routes - Elwynn Forest recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics, designs and manuals whose SOURCE is
# in Elwynn Forest, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item and vendor tables). Everything here is vendor-sold: the drop scan over all
# 279 Elwynn-spawning NPCs found no recipe dropped exclusively from Elwynn
# sources (every dropped recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop), and quest
# records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those.
# Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/elwynn-forest-recipes
title Elwynn Forest - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-10
zone Elwynn Forest
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords elwynn, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Goldshire (Tharynn Bouden)
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 66 -- Tharynn Bouden (41.82, 67.16)
  buy 6325 "Recipe: Brilliant Smallfish"
  buy 6328 "Recipe: Longjaw Mud Snapper"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Tailoring — Goldshire (Tharynn Bouden)
  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 66 -- Tharynn Bouden (41.82, 67.16)
  buy 6270 "Pattern: Blue Linen Vest"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Tailoring — Eastvale (Drake Lindgren)
  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 1250 -- Drake Lindgren (83.31, 66.69)
  buy 6272 "Pattern: Blue Linen Robe"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.
